## Stdout Minimal — Pino / Logrus

Minimal footprint: structured JSON to stdout, Prometheus client library only. No Grafana, no log aggregation.

### Install

```bash
# Node.js
npm install pino prom-client

# Go
go get github.com/sirupsen/logrus github.com/prometheus/client_golang/prometheus
```

### Pino configuration (Node.js)

```typescript
import pino from 'pino'

export const logger = pino({
  level: process.env.LOG_LEVEL ?? 'info',
  base: { service: '<%= projectName %>' },
  formatters: {
    level: (label) => ({ level: label }),
  },
})
```

### Prometheus metrics endpoint

```typescript
import { register } from 'prom-client'
import { collectDefaultMetrics } from 'prom-client'

collectDefaultMetrics({ prefix: '<%= projectName %>_' })

app.get('/metrics', async (_req, res) => {
  res.set('Content-Type', register.contentType)
  res.send(await register.metrics())
})
```

### Environment variables

```env
LOG_LEVEL=info
METRICS_PORT=9090
```
