## VictoriaMetrics + Vector + Quickwit — Lightweight Self-host Stack

Prometheus-compatible metrics (VictoriaMetrics), log routing (Vector), fast log search (Quickwit).

### docker-compose.vm-stack.yml

```yaml
version: '3.8'
services:
  victoriametrics:
    image: victoriametrics/victoria-metrics:stable
    container_name: victoriametrics
    ports:
      - '8428:8428'   # Prometheus-compatible API
    volumes:
      - vm-data:/storage
    command:
      - --storageDataPath=/storage
      - --retentionPeriod=30d
    restart: unless-stopped

  vector:
    image: timberio/vector:latest-alpine
    container_name: vector
    volumes:
      - ./vector.yaml:/etc/vector/vector.yaml:ro
    depends_on: [victoriametrics, quickwit]
    restart: unless-stopped

  quickwit:
    image: quickwit/quickwit:latest
    container_name: quickwit
    ports:
      - '7280:7280'   # UI + API
    volumes:
      - quickwit-data:/quickwit/qwdata
    command: run
    restart: unless-stopped

volumes:
  vm-data:
  quickwit-data:
```

### Prometheus scrape config (VictoriaMetrics)

```yaml
# prometheus.yml — Victoria accepts standard Prometheus format
scrape_configs:
  - job_name: '<%= projectName %>'
    static_configs:
      - targets: ['host.docker.internal:9090']
```

### Environment variables

```env
VICTORIAMETRICS_URL=http://localhost:8428
QUICKWIT_URL=http://localhost:7280
VECTOR_CONFIG=./vector.yaml
```
