## Datadog — SaaS APM + Logs + Metrics

Enterprise-grade. Unified platform — APM, infrastructure, logs, RUM.

### Install

```bash
npm install dd-trace
```

### Initialization (must be first import)

```typescript
// tracing.ts — import before any other module
import tracer from 'dd-trace'

tracer.init({
  service: '<%= projectName %>',
  env: process.env.NODE_ENV,
  version: process.env.npm_package_version,
  logInjection: true,  // injects traceId into Pino/Winston logs
})

export default tracer
```

### Structured log correlation

```typescript
import { createLogger } from 'winston'
// With logInjection=true, dd-trace injects dd.trace_id automatically
// traceId is available as dd.trace_id in log output
```

### Environment variables

```env
DD_API_KEY=<your-datadog-api-key>
DD_SITE=datadoghq.com
DD_SERVICE=<%= projectName %>
DD_ENV=production
```
