## Axiom — SaaS Logs + Events

Excellent for log/event analytics. Generous free tier (500GB/month).

### Install

```bash
npm install @axiomhq/winston
# or
npm install @axiomhq/pino
```

### Pino transport

```typescript
import pino from 'pino'

export const logger = pino({
  level: 'info',
  transport: {
    target: '@axiomhq/pino',
    options: {
      dataset: process.env.AXIOM_DATASET,
      token: process.env.AXIOM_TOKEN,
    },
  },
  base: { service: '<%= projectName %>' },
})

// Every log line includes traceId
logger.info({ traceId: ctx.traceId, msg: 'request completed' })
```

### Environment variables

```env
AXIOM_TOKEN=xaat-<your-token>
AXIOM_DATASET=<%= projectName %>-logs
```
