## BetterStack — SaaS Logs + Uptime

Logs + uptime monitoring in one. Good for teams wanting incident correlation.

### Install

```bash
npm install @logtail/pino
```

### Pino transport

```typescript
import pino from 'pino'
import { Logtail } from '@logtail/node'
import { LogtailTransport } from '@logtail/pino'

const logtail = new Logtail(process.env.BETTERSTACK_SOURCE_TOKEN!)

export const logger = pino({ level: 'info' }, new LogtailTransport(logtail))

// Every log line includes traceId
logger.info({ traceId: ctx.traceId, msg: 'request completed' })
```

### Environment variables

```env
BETTERSTACK_SOURCE_TOKEN=<your-source-token>
```
